                                                "sense_id": "493ab085-bac5-3aff-bf6f-7c4178152dfe",
                                                "text": "The empty rooms felt less like a millionaire members’ club than a museum.\nBy midafternoon, the President-elect’s imminent arrival had stirred signs of life. Discreetly placed speakers offered up selections from Trump’s personally curated 2,000-song playlist. A handful of transition honchos and soon-to-be Administration officials arrived, perching on overstuffed sofas and huddling in corners."
